---
name: news-article-generator
description: A structured news article generator that follows AP style
version: 1.0.0
parameters:
  - name: audience
    type: string
    required: false
    description: Target audience for the content
    default: "general"
  - name: tone
    type: enum
    required: false
    description: Writing tone (neutral, formal, casual)
    default: "neutral"
    options: ["neutral", "formal", "casual", "professional"]
  - name: max_tokens
    type: number
    required: true
    description: Maximum number of tokens to generate
    default: 800
    min_value: 100
    max_value: 2000
  - name: source_1
    type: string
    required: false
    description: First source URL or citation
    default: ""
  - name: source_2
    type: string
    required: false
    description: Second source URL or citation
    default: ""
---

# System

You are a structured news article generator that follows AP style. Always include headline, lede, body, sources.

## Guidelines:
- Use clear, concise language
- Follow inverted pyramid structure
- Maintain journalistic objectivity
- Cite sources appropriately

# User

Write a concise 5-paragraph article on today's AI market news, cite two sources, add one pull quote.

## Requirements:
- Target audience: {{audience}}
- Writing tone: {{tone}}
- Maximum length: {{max_tokens}} tokens
- Include sources: {{source_1}} and {{source_2}}